~ clear_robot
Allie: The robot thing must have happened after I went to the bathroom right before my shift
Roadie: Does that line up with you too?
Allie: It does, Mr. P was in his office after I came out and started working
Roadie: Okay
Roadie: Did you see anything else related to the case?
Allie: Only a tray of pineapple outside of the kitchen for some reason
: Allie hands you A tray of tiny cubed pineapple chunks.
Roadie: I had these in the fridge? Mr. P discontinued the pineapple pepperoncini pesto pizza last week.
Allie: You didn't move them?
Roadie: No, I don't think anyone was in the kitchen other than me tonight, but these are still cold in the middle.
Allie: I don't want to point any fingers, but Harry used to have your job
Roadie: Really? Did he bring his 'accessories' into work too
Allie: Yea, part of why he got fired actually
Roadie: I do believe that. This is something to go off of, thanks A.
Roadie: Seeya around R.
=> END